# When INBOX is renamed by another program while the panel is open, there is no INBOX project: Enter adds nothing.
file <<END
INBOX:
	- Old item
Work:
END
keys q
type Keep me
see Quick Add → INBOX
outside <<END
Inbox:
	- Old item
Work:
END
status Reloaded
see No INBOX project in the Navigator
see - Keep me
keys <Enter>
see No INBOX project in the Navigator
keys <Esc>
quit
saved <<END
Inbox:
	- Old item
Work:
END
